        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The creator reflected on the inefficiencies of traditional teaching methods in high school.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "km26__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The project aims to teach basic concepts to distracted kids using a game based on real-life scenarios.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "km26__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The game will require school tools to solve everyday problems.",
      "dimensions": [
        "objectives"
      ],
      "type": "mitigation",
      "primary_dimension": "objectives",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "km26__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The inclusion of a story in the game is intended to help kids understand the relevance of what they are learning.",
